# Fiber Backbone: Spine league, track 1. Long flowing sweepers along the
# main fiber run, driven clockwise on the map image: a sweeper along the
# top, a big right-hander, then a long loop that reaches back into the
# middle of the map and out again, down the east side, then the bottom
# straight west where the floor is broken and there are no rails: hop the
# gap or fall into the city. The cold aisle runs up the west side, then an
# S to the line. Control point 0 is the start line; features on point i
# apply to the segment from point i to i+1.
league spine
width 60
# x    y    half   features
 320  120   64                     # start line
 540  220   60                     # a long sweeper along the top
 800  140   60
 890  280   56
 820  370   56                     # sweeper back in toward the middle
 480  380   56
 350  410   56
 300  500   56
 350  590   56
 480  620   56
 780  620   56
 890  730   56
 800  890   64     open hop        # the broken floor: hop the gap
 400  900   64
 250  880   60
 150  770   56     cold            # cold aisle up the west side
 140  560   56
 140  440   56
 205  320   56                     # an S up the west wall
 150  210   56
 210  125   60
